ibes the engineering design decisions, internal endpoint behavio\r\nmetadata: {'total_chunks': 1, 'file_name': 'ENG_V2_DOC-zrjpjb1ejo.md', 'last_modified_at': '2026-07-04T03:39:56.387Z', 'chunk_length': 241, 'metadata': None, 'size': 243, 'chunk_index': 0, 'group_name': ['default'], 'doc_type': 'text/markdown', 'modalities': ['image', 'text'], 'page_content': None, 'source_doc_length': 241}\r\nscore: 0.0005429715965874493\r\n"]
