[352.706209, "o", "contexts: 9\r\n---\r\nfile_name: batch-zrthdq6dz6.md\r\ngroup_name: ['eng', 'v1', 'v2', 'docs']\r\ncontent: {\"# Document A (zrthdq6dz6)\":\"Engineering v1 release notes: new deployment pipeline, observability dashboards, and on-call rotations for the platform team. Marker: docA.\"}\r\nscore: 0.9995242357254028\r\n---\r\nfile_name: docA-zr38f3t745.md\r\ngroup_name: ['eng', 'v1']\r\ncontent: {\"---\":\"file_name: docA-zr38f3t745.md\"}\r\nscore: 7.680229464313015e-05\r\n---\r\nfile_name: b2b_article_ai_agents_zrounejlw2.md\r\ngroup_name: ['b2b-newsletter']\r\ncontent: AI agents are REDACTEDnomous software systems built on top of large language models (LLMs). They plan multi-step workflows, call external tools, and reflect on their own outputs. Modern agentic systems co\r\nscore: 3.577938332455233e-05\r\n---\r\nfile_name: memory_team-standup-zrh0shwrnq\r\ngroup_name: ['default']\r\ncontent: Sounds good. I can take the API contract changes and review the analytics dashboard.\r\nscore: 3.217352059436962e-05\r\n---\r\nfile_name: batch-zrthdq6dz6.md\r\ngroup_name: ['eng', 'v1', 'v2', 'docs']\r\ncontent: {\"# Document C (zrthdq6dz6)\":\"Public-facing docs v1: user guide, installation, and FAQ for the initial GA release. Marker: docC.\"}\r\nscore: 0.0021975571289658546\r\n"]
